// Clue Name :
"P4197949523" "Desslock's Virus"
// DetailString :
"P1726765063" "Desslock fashioned a virus to replicate the master Destined One list over any of its copies on other networked computers. After it finishes it will act like a Freedom Corps watchdog program in order to throw the Arachnos techs off the trail of anyone affecting the Destined One lists."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NewList 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3348299790" "The New List"
// DetailString :
"P3927098092" "You have a copy of the new list that you created. It has your name listed among the list of possible 'Destined Ones'. You have taken your first step in your master plan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4084047224" "So, you come to me because you want to pretend you are a <color deepskyblue>Destined One</color>, eh? Want all the perks that go with being one of the few, the proud, the Tools of Lord Recluse?<br><br>Well, I can see advantages for myself in helping you out here, so I am willing to do this with you. You are going to owe me a lot of favors for my help, but we can cross that bridge when you are a bit more powerful. <color orange>For now, you gotta put your name onto the list.</color> You do know there is a list, right? <color deepskyblue>Kalinda</color>, one of Lord Recluse's seers, divined who the actual Destined Ones can be, and made a list. It's electronic so it shouldn't be too hard to insert your name onto it. I even have a virus you can upload that will stick your name onto all the copies on the Arachnos computer network as well. It will also show you as one of the lucky ones who escaped from Zigursky.<br><br>It's a simple job, and brings with it the benefit of being one of Lord Recluse's Destined Ones. Pretty good for a day's work, I'd say."
// AcceptString :
"P1272236059" "Alter the Destined One list and insert your own name onto it."
// SendOffString :
"P1736545963" "Once you finish, you should start seeing the benefits of your work immediately by seeing Operative Kuzmin for some Destiny-related jobs."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2679051176" "Alter Destined One List"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3504747042" "You look like you haven't actually done the dirty work yet, now go out and put {HeroName} on that list!"
